  "title": "CONSTRUCTION OF IRREDUCIBLE REPRESENTATIONS OVER KHOVANOV-LAUDA-ROUQUIER ALGEBRAS",
  "authors_raw": "OF FINITE CLASSICAL TYPE",
  "title_lines": [
   "CONSTRUCTION OF IRREDUCIBLE REPRESENTATIONS",
   "OVER KHOVANOV-LAUDA-ROUQUIER ALGEBRAS"
  ],
  "abstract": "We give an explicit construction of irreducible modules ove r Khovanov-Lauda- Rouquier algebras R and their cyclotomic quotients R\u03bb for \ufb01nite classical types using a crystal basis theoretic approach. More precisely, for each element v of the crystal B(\u221e ) (resp. B(\u03bb )), we \ufb01rst construct certain modules \u2206( a; k) labeled by the adapted string a of v. We then prove that the head of the induced module Ind ( \u2206( a; 1)\u22a0\u00b7 \u00b7 \u00b7\u22a0\u2206( a; n) ) is irreducible and that every irreducible R-module (resp. R\u03bb-module) can be realized as the irreducible head of one of the induced modules Ind(\u2206( a; 1) \u22a0 \u00b7 \u00b7 \u00b7\u22a0 \u2206( a; n)). Moreover, we show that our construction is compatible with the crystal structure o n B(\u221e ) (resp. B(\u03bb )).",
